{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3ad5d958-5e19-8aa9-8ea3-82eface38b7f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T11:25:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Timothy Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:22:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Yes, I am calling about a manhole cover on my street. It has sunk down, below the road, and every time a car go over it, it rings. Like a loud metal bang."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. A sunken manhole cover that clangs when cars cross. Where is it located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in front of my house, 116 Marsh Street. In the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "116 Marsh Street. Did I get that right, Marsh like the wetland?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, Marsh, M-A-R-S-H. Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is the cover sitting lower than the pavement around it, or is it the pavement that's cracked around the edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The cover is lower, maybe a few inches. The asphalt around it is a little broken. And my neighbor, he hit it too, with his car. He told me it shook the whole car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so at least one vehicle has hit it. Did he have any damage that he mentioned?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He did not say damage. Only the hit, very hard. He was surprised."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:23:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll write this up as a sunken manhole cover with broken pavement, 116 Marsh Street, and a vehicle has struck it. I'll send it to the crew that handles road repairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, can I ask, how long do repairs like this usually take? Just so I know what to expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the workload. In winter, they're often tied up with other things, so it could be a couple of weeks, sometimes a bit more. Something that's a hazard tends to get looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I understand. A couple weeks, maybe more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled? I have a number here, but I'd like to confirm it with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0158."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0158. Is that your cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my cell. Um, sorry, if I am slow to answer, I am also waiting for a buyer. I sold a bicycle online this morning and he is supposed to message me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:24:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. If we miss you, we'll leave a message. Your name again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:25:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Timothy Hazard. Hazard, like it sounds. H-A-Z-A-R-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Hazard. I've got it all down. The report is in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T11:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
